  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together sazon seasoning, orange juice, lime juice, and yeast.",
    "Add the pork shoulder to the bowl and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Remove the pork from the marinade and grill for 5-7 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, grill the onion and pineapple for 2-3 minutes per side, or until lightly charred.",
    "Warm the tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds.",
    "Assemble the tacos by slicing the grilled pork into thin strips and serving with onion, pineapple, and cilantro in individual mini cocottes.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
